ogies to fulfill its pivotal role in ETRI’s vision of ‘Technology pioneer creating a happy future world through digital innovation.’ We are promoting the development of ultra-high performance hardware and software strategic technology for AI. We have established a strategic goal to realize disruptive innovative computing through the development of computing systems and infrastructure to overcome performance limitations. To achieve this goal, we are developing key technologies for future computing systems, including hardware using intelligent semiconductors and quantum computing, but also system software supports them. In particular, we pursue open technology innovation through close collaboration with domestic and foreign universities and companies so that the computing systems developed by ET',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'free','primary','not_applicable',NULL,NULL,'https://www.etri.re.kr/eng/sub6/sub6_0101.etri?departCode=10',NULL,2,'B','V2',200,'V2: institution certifiée 3/3, URL ouverte anonymement, titre et contenu vérifiés automatiquement. V3 réservé à une validation plus forte.','ef913bdbb421d87c704b188c13570afc83c3348a3395ea043b68bc1ec0a86748','be15fe2ac5208e3c8e039799a0a8c8750f312848df228b3cd8defcb25a8112b5',1,1,1,1 FROM sources WHERE root_url='https://www.etri.re.kr/eng/main/main.etri' ON CONFLICT(canonical_hash) DO UPDATE SET consulted_at=excluded.consulted_at,http_status=excluded.http_status,content_sha256=excluded.content_sha256,exact_title=excluded.exact_title,factual_summary=excluded.factual_summary,active=1;
