ts in a particular proceeding. Are these efforts sufficient to empower participants and inform regulators? This series of sessions will discuss successful approaches and valuable characteristics for enhancing participants’ understanding of the data and their ability to access and use it.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'free','primary','not_applicable',NULL,NULL,'https://www.pnnl.gov/events/data-everyone-creating-data-supported-decision-making-environment-advocatestechnology',NULL,4,'B','V2',200,'V2: institution certifiée 3/3, URL ouverte anonymement, titre et contenu vérifiés automatiquement. V3 réservé à une validation plus forte.','e1aa307ef1bcc14f25450b34eaf511d5d7f7efee30631357ef43f335c01905c0','76da8dbce192968bb9ecd4dea81e58aa368a886f62c0cb8ce6f5fc43d2162b48',1,1,1,1 FROM sources WHERE root_url='https://www.pnnl.gov/' ON CONFLICT(canonical_hash) DO UPDATE SET consulted_at=excluded.consulted_at,http_status=excluded.http_status,content_sha256=excluded.content_sha256,exact_title=excluded.exact_title,factual_summary=excluded.factual_summary,active=1;
